                  "explanation": "Identify, research, and record  improvements.  Research can be internally or externally focused, and  may include:  \u2022 Techniques  \u2022 Methods  \u2022 Process frameworks  \u2022 Objective evaluations  Use established criteria to decide  what documents and measures are  critical enough to include in the  organization\u2019s Process Asset Library  (PAL) for use with o"
