                  "value": "Ensures process improvements provide value to the organization over time.  Additional Required Information  This section left blank for future content.",
                  "explanation": "Identify the mechanisms needed to  support process implementation and  deployment.  May include:  \u2022 User groups, e.g., communities of practice  \u2022 Management communication, such as:  o All-hands meetings  o Newsletters  o Webinars  \u2022 Feedback to proposers of process changes  Ensure that implementation and  deployment activities are planned and  coor"
